{"format":"megamek-board","version":3,"size":{"width":42,"height":32},"name":"Cliff Roads","description":"Roads cut into cliffs. North-west: two ledges between a level 8 cliff and level 0 ground, a road and a road with a railway, level at 4, then descending along the cliff's foot. North: a coast road climbing a sea cliff between a level 8 cliff and the sea. North-east: bridges between level 7 mesas over a level 1 canyon: flush, with a railway, and ramped up from lower ground. South: roads spiralling up mesas between their cliffs and the ground, a road and a road with a railway, and a tight hairpin turning onto a climbing leg. Inspect in Classic and Enhanced.","options":{"exitRoadsToPavement":false},"tags":["Example"],"notes":[{"at":[5,2],"text":["Ledge road"]},{"at":[11,2],"text":["Ledge road and rail"]},{"at":[21,2],"text":["Coast road"]},{"at":[32,3],"text":["Mesa bridges"]},{"at":[8,24],"text":["Spiral road"]},{"at":[22,24],"text":["Spiral road and rail"]},{"at":[36,24],"text":["Hairpin turn"]}],
